{"path":"chemistry/experiments/lab/gas-purify","title":"气体净化与干燥顺序（除杂为先、干燥在后）","type":"example","html":"<p>实验室用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{MnO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Mn</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与浓盐酸加热制取 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cl_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，产物气体中混有水蒸气与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HCl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HCl</span></span></span></span></span>。为得到干燥纯净的氯气，依次通过试剂的最佳顺序是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 饱和食盐水 → 浓硫酸</p>\n<p>B. 浓硫酸 → 饱和食盐水</p>\n<p>C. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NaOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaOH</span></span></span></span></span> 溶液 → 浓硫酸</p>\n<p>D. 浓硫酸 → <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NaOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaOH</span></span></span></span></span> 溶液</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通用&quot;除杂→干燥&quot;判断：<strong>湿法除杂放干燥前</strong>（水洗/洗气瓶/溶液 → 干燥管）；</li>\n<li>常见气体净化对照：<strong>CO₂</strong>（混 HCl 用饱和 NaHCO₃ 除去——不用 NaOH，因为 NaOH 也会吸收 CO₂；浓硫酸干燥）；<strong>NH₃</strong>（常见杂质为水汽，用<strong>碱石灰</strong>干燥，不能用浓硫酸——会被 NH₃ 反应吸收）；<strong>Cl₂</strong>（用饱和食盐水除 HCl；浓硫酸除水）；</li>\n<li>检验顺序（不同考点但同思路）：<strong>先检验水、再检验其他</strong>（先检验水蒸气因为后续装置都可能带水）；</li>\n<li>尾气处理：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cl_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 尾气用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NaOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaOH</span></span></span></span></span> 溶液吸收（此时允许吸收主气体）;</li>\n<li>真题关联：气体制备与除杂干燥为新课标化学选填/实验综合的高频题。🔗 真题公开资料：<a href=\"https://gaokao.neea.edu.cn/\">中国教育考试网·普通高考</a>（官方试题评析）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>第一步（除 HCl）</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cl_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在水中的溶解度虽然不大，但 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HCl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HCl</span></span></span></span></span> 极易溶于水。用<strong>饱和食盐水</strong>（氯化钠饱和溶液）代替纯水：NaCl 电离出的大量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cl^-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 抑制氯气的溶解（同离子效应），气体里 <strong><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HCl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HCl</span></span></span></span></span> 被洗去而 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cl_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 损失极小</strong>——这是专门针对&quot;氯气+氯化氢&quot;混合气的经典除杂试剂；</p>\n<p><strong>第二步（干燥）</strong>：除杂吸收装置带出水蒸气，所以干燥放<strong>最后</strong>：浓硫酸作干燥剂（吸水性、不与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cl_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反应）。</p>\n<p>⇒ 顺序 <strong>&quot;先除杂（饱和食盐水）、后干燥（浓硫酸）&quot;</strong>，选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么 C 错</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cl_2+2NaOH\\to NaCl+NaClO+H_2O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2NaOH</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaCl</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaClO</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span></span></span></span></span>——<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NaOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaOH</span></span></span></span></span> 会把氯气本身也吸收掉（主气体被反应了）! 不能用碱液除 HCl（除非制取后不需要氯气本身，如尾气处理）。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;先除杂、后干燥；酸性除杂不碰主气体，干燥剂也不碰主气体&quot;</strong>；\n氯气特例速记：<strong>&quot;食盐洗酸，硫酸滴水&quot;</strong>（饱和食盐水洗掉 HCl，浓硫酸吸掉水）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：洗气装置是湿式的，一定有水汽进来，所以&quot;干了再洗&quot;等于白干；而选试剂就看两件事——除杂不留主气？（不能反应掉主气体）+ 干燥不碰主气体？</p>\n<p>30 秒出 A。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"实验室用 M n O 2 \\mathrm{MnO_2} Mn O 2 ​ 与浓盐酸加热制取 C l 2 \\mathrm{Cl_2} C l 2 ​ ，产物气体中混有水蒸气与 H C l \\mathrm{HCl} HCl 。为得到干燥纯净的氯","source":"自编（经典考法：气体制备综合为新课标高频）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"除杂（除酸性杂质）用\"饱和食盐水/水\"等湿法时要在干燥**之前**（否则先干燥又被弄湿）；除杂试剂不能与主气体反应；干燥剂不能与主气体反应（如 NH₃ 不能用浓硫酸、Cl₂ 不能用 NaOH 等碱性干燥剂）。顺序口诀：\"先除杂、后干燥\"。","fit":["Cl₂ 制备中 HCl 的除去与干燥","干燥剂选择","顺序判断","选填题"],"updated":"Tue Mar 04 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"化学实验"},{"slug":"lab","title":"化学实验"},{"slug":"gas-purify","title":"气体净化与干燥顺序（除杂为先、干燥在后）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"design-evaluation","title":"实验方案设计与评价","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"化学实验专题","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"gas-prep","title":"气体制备与净化（先除杂后干燥）","type":"example"},{"slug":"haloalkane-br-test","title":"溴乙烷中溴元素的检验","type":"example"},{"slug":"industrial-flow-example","title":"工业流程除杂（调 pH 不引杂质）","type":"example"},{"slug":"industrial-process","title":"化学工艺流程题模板","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"solution-prep-error","title":"配制溶液误差分析（定容俯仰视）","type":"example"}]}